    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "2) En autobús: un viaje panorámico"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000020",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "3) Por Servees: Conexiones Comunitarias"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000031",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000021",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "En la estación de autobuses, en el mismo "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000022"
       ],
       "text": "lugar donde se encuentran los"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000024",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " autobuses, hay servios y minibuses."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000025",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000026",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Para llegar a la estación desde la estación de tren, un viaje en taxi cuesta 15¤ o 0,50¤ en un taxi comunal."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000027",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000028",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000029"
       ],
       "text": "Los taxis comunales son"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " una opción económica."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "is7dkg7w8t3b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " Una plaza en un servees o minibús a "
      },
      {
       "_key": "fbco9bgryk19",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "6hfuggkuuy4b"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "tyl64wpca720",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " te costará 18¤, mientras que el viaje a Kom Ombo cuesta 7¤, y la ruta a "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000002e"
       ],
       "text": "Edfu"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000030",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " tiene un precio de 15¤. "
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000022",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
